  {
   "n": 23,
   "type": "MCQ",
   "section": "Technical",
   "tags": "Technical • COMPUTER SCIENCE • +1 / -0.33",
   "html": "<p>\n\tWhich of the following is/are correct regarding AVL tree?<br />\n\t<em>S</em><sub>1</sub> : In an AVL tree, during the insert operation there are atmost two rotations required.<br />\n\t<em>S</em><sub>2</sub> : AVL tree can be used to implement an optimal comparison based sorting algorithm.</p>",
   "options": [
