   ],
   "natRange": null,
   "answerText": "C",
   "marks": {
    "pos": 1,
    "neg": 0.33
   },
   "solution": "<p>\n\t(c)<br />\n\t<em>S</em><sub>1</sub> : The AVL property is restored on every operation. Therefore inserting another item will require at most two rotations to restore the balance.<br />\n\t<em>S</em><sub>2</sub> : AVL tree can be used to sort N numbers in &Omicron;(N log N) time, by inserting all the numbers in the tree, and iteratively calling next largest N times.</p>"
  },
